		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Colossal, four-armed, wingless dragon-kin with ridged scarlet scales. Incredibly vain, narcissistic.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 18, <strong>HP</strong> 58, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +9 (2d8) and 2 claws +9 (2d6) or 1 molten breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (climb, fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Death Curse</strong>. When slain, death curses the slayer. WIS 15+ or cursed to take double damage from fire, and their blood catches fire in open air.</p><p></p><p><strong>Lavablood</strong>. Fire immune. Can swim in lava.</p><p></p><p><strong>Molten Breath</strong>. A straight line (5' wide) extending double near from linnorm. DEX 15+ or 3d8 damage and set aflame.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
